{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8054","id":5228558376,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABN6V4KA","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8054","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8054.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8054.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8054","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8054/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8054/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8054/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/b1aa6620ca57d7004e36c479439a96d17f2dc2a5","number":8054,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(acp-adapter): validate --server at startup (#6939)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #6939.\n\n`bin/opencode-acp-adapter.mjs` took its one operator flag, `--server`, with no validation: a trailing `--server` was silently dropped (adapter talked to the default serve), `--server=` / a flag-like / a non-URL value looped forever on per-request \"Failed to parse URL\", and a typo'd flag (`--sever`) was silently ignored.\n\n## Change\nStrict argv at startup in `parseServerUrl` (umbrella #3352), evaluated before the event stream starts and before any ACP traffic:\n- `--server` with a missing (trailing), empty (`--server=` or `--server \"\"`), or flag-like (`--…`) value → usage error on stderr naming the flag and the offending value, exit 2.\n- A value that is not a parseable `http:`/`https:` URL → same fast failure; the resolved `OPENCODE_ACP_SERVER` env value is validated the same way (named as the source).\n- Any unknown argument (e.g. the `--sever` typo) → usage error naming it, exit 2 — it can no longer silently change which server is dialled.\n- Valid forms unchanged: `--server <url>`, `--server=<url>`, trailing slashes stripped, env fallback, built-in default (verified live: control still starts against the named server).\n\n## Tests\n`node --test bin/opencode-acp-adapter.test.mjs` — 18 pass / 0 fail, including 8 new #6939 regression tests: trailing `--server`, `--server=`, `--server \"\"`, flag-like value, non-URL value, non-http(s) value, typo'd flag, and a bad env value — each asserting the fast non-zero exit naming `--server` (or the env var). The existing well-formed `--server` control suite keeps passing.\n\nQueue task 11326 (lane code-m, direct execution lane).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796838834&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8054&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8054&signature=cfc6143b02eed954450ca6c30cb7e868a4e605718328591fe2bc0bd6b9cf57a3\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcse